aker continuity in certain cohorts.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/BHARTIARTL_10082026185505_Stx_Intimation.pdf","page":5.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"deteriorated","statement":"Aggressive promotional pricing in fixed wireless access led to customer round-tripping and degraded acquisition quality.","quote":"I think the real issue there was the fact was we went down on very aggressive low acquisition pricing in the market and that led to some round tripping and quality of acquisition deteriorating.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/BHARTIARTL_10082026185505_Stx_Intimation.pdf","page":8.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"demand","statement":"Demand for home broadband is being fueled by smart TV adoption, evolving data usage, and greater concurrent consumption.","quote":"Demand for high-speed connectivity continues to be supported by rising smart TV penetration, higher concurrent usage within households and rapidly evolving data consumption needs.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/BHARTIARTL_10082026185505_Stx_Intimation.pdf","page":5.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"demand","statement":"Enterprise customers are demanding services beyond traditional connectivity, opening opportunities in broader digital portfolios.","quote":"Enterprise demand is moving beyond traditional connectivity, creating significant opportunities across our portfolio. We are approaching this opportunity with a clear execution plan across three areas.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/BHARTIARTL_10082026185505_Stx_Intimation.pdf","page":5.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"pricing","statement":"Management emphasized that the telecom industry's long-term tariff structure must be repaired to charge for data consumption.","quote":"I do want to reiterate that the longer-term pricing architecture of the industry still needs to be repaired and